<title>JAPAN: Fanuc - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fanuc - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 76.31		vs	   76.98</p>
<p> Operating	   22.54		vs	   22.60</p>
<p> Current	     23.44		vs	   24.60</p>
<p> Net		   12.81		vs	   13.55</p>
<p> EPS		   53.51 yen	  vs	   56.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    239 million	  vs	 239 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 11.00 yen	  vs	   10.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fanuc Ltd is a major manufacturer of numerical control equipment for machine tools.</p>
